			"notes": "Release Notes:\n- Added Feature: Portals that teleport a player to any dimension or redirect to another Minecraft server when walked into\n- Added Feature: RTP command to teleport to a random location\n- Added Feature: A player riding animals, minecarts, etc. is teleported with their ride and all passengers in it\n- The command `/spawn` now uses the Minecraft world spawn as a fallback if the spawn target was not set with `/setspawn`\n- Code cleanup, added Github actions"
